WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.400
The village lanterns fade behind you as you follow the crooked road through orchards and abandoned farms.

2
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:18.900
Small fiends steal signposts, scramble milestones, and scatter your neighbours’ belongings.

3
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:29.100
Your first spells are little more than sparks and gusts. But with each victory, the road straightens beneath your feet.

4
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.600
Someone is afraid you will.

5
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.100
Act I: Beyond the Village · Levels 1–10
